              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 13.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Maze mbona iryo hembe rirwanya abera ryenda kubanesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 20.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kugeza aho Umukuru nyir'ibihe byose yaziye agatsindishiriza abera b'Isumbabyose. Igihe kirasohora abera bahabwa ubwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Maze wa wundi arambwira ati ‘Iyo nyamaswa ya kane izaba ubwami bwa kane ku isi, kandi buzaba budasa n'ubundi bwami bwose, buzaconshomera isi yose buyisiribange, buyimenagure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 17.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ayo mahembe cumi, muri ubwo bwami hazakomokamo abami cumi. Hanyuma yabo hazaza undi mwami, ariko we ntazaba asa n'abo ba mbere kandi azanesha abami batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 12.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5+REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13.5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni we uzavuga ibyo kugomera Isumbabyose, kandi azarenganya abera b'Isumbabyose. Azigira inama zo guhindura ibihe n'amategeko, kandi bizarekerwa mu maboko ye kugeza aho igihe n'ibihe n'igice cy'igihe bizashirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma urubanza ruzashingwa, bazamunyaga ubutware ngo babumareho burimburwe kugeza ku mperuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 20.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maze ubwami n'ubutware n'icyubahiro cy'ubwami bwose buri munsi y'ijuru, bizahabwe ubwoko bw'abera b'Isumbabyose. Ubwami bwayo ni ubwami buzahoraho iteka, kandi ubutware bwose buzajya buyikorera buyumvire.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
